# CI deploy workflow, kept locally but out of the repo: the gh token in use has
# no `workflow` scope, so GitHub rejects any push that touches it. Deploys run
# via `npm run deploy` (gh-pages branch) instead. To switch to CI, run
# `gh auth refresh -s workflow`, drop this line, and commit the file.
.github/workflows/deploy.yml
